OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA few light
OL,6,Fshowers continuing in the evening
OL,7,Falongside some bright spells. These
OL,8,Fshowers will become fewer through the
OL,9,Frest of the night. Moderate to fresh
OL,10,Fwesterly winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FA good deal of dry weather for
OL,13,Fmuch of the day but a few showers not
OL,14,Fto be ruled out. Best of the sunnier
OL,15,Fspells for Orkney.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FA dry
OL,18,Fstart to Monday, but rain spreads
OL,19,Fnorth later in the day. Variable cloud
OL,20,Famounts on Tuesday and Wednesday with
OL,21,Frisk of showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
